=== sc-P1 (rejection): real column vs scalar output ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Cross-table WHERE conditions (e.g., a.x > b.y) are only supported in queries with aggregation (GROUP BY / aggregate functions).  Split into separate conditions per table, or add aggregation.

=== sc-P2 (rejection): comma cross-join of real tables ===
This query has no aggregate expression, so it is not an aggregate query.
Currently, RonSQL only supports aggregate queries and projection-only
SELECTs: single-table, left-deep join chains over real tables and/or
complete-key CTE lookups (INNER / LEFT JOIN), comma cross-joins of
scalar CTEs, and CTE_SCAN roots — all without ORDER BY / LIMIT /
GROUP BY / expressions.  See non_aggregate_pushdown_plan.md for the
broader roadmap.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Not an aggregate query.

